{"product":{"id":7879136411900,"title":"POLYGON - Meadow Forest - Nature Biome","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ciframe title=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/PbUTzpZfEV0\" class=\"ratio-16-by-9\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSynty® Studios presents:  POLYGON - Meadow Forest - Nature Biome\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCome and fly away to the magical meadow forest and immerse yourself in this idyllic landscape surrounded by natural beauty. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePOLYGON - Meadow Forest holds the essence of serenity. From layered hills with grassy fields to a wide variety of flowers, trees, and plants. Butterflies are fluttering throughout the air, and birds nesting in the trees. What better way to fly your kite and experience the sunset?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBut, with so much bliss, what could you find when going off the beaten track? Are there secrets lurking in the spaces between the trees? Come find out for yourself.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWant to add an extra layer of magic to your game?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe recommend combining POLYGON Meadows Forest with:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca rel=\"noopener\" title=\"POLYGON - Farm Pack\" href=\"https:\/\/syntystore.com\/products\/polygon-farm-pack\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePOLYGON - Farm\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca rel=\"noopener\" title=\"POLYGON - Fantasy Kingdom Pack\" href=\"https:\/\/syntystore.com\/collections\/frontpage\/products\/polygon-fantasy-kingdom\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePOLYGON - Fantasy Kingdom\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca rel=\"noopener\" title=\"POLYGON - Dog Pack\" href=\"https:\/\/syntystore.com\/collections\/frontpage\/products\/polygon-dog\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePOLYGON - Dog Pack\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOr maybe - you would like to transform this into something more peculiar:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca rel=\"noopener\" title=\"POLYGON - Dungeon Realms\" href=\"https:\/\/syntystore.com\/collections\/frontpage\/products\/polygon-dungeon-realms\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePOLYGON - Dungeon Realms\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca rel=\"noopener\" title=\"POLYGON - Battle Royale Pack\" href=\"https:\/\/syntystore.com\/collections\/frontpage\/products\/polygon-battle-royale-pack\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePOLYGON - Battle Royale\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca rel=\"noopener\" title=\"POLYGON - Sci-Fi Worlds Pack\" href=\"https:\/\/syntystore.com\/collections\/frontpage\/products\/polygon-sci-fi-worlds\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePOLYGON - Sci-Fi Worlds\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca rel=\"noopener\" title=\"POLYGON - War Pack\" href=\"https:\/\/syntystore.com\/collections\/frontpage\/products\/polygon-war-pack\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePOLYGON – War\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*\u003cem\u003eContents may vary between engines. \u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e📦 Pack Content\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA Beautiful demo scene environment - Flowing meadows, stream, forest and a few hidden surprises.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnvironment (x79): \u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eFruit trees, giant trees, birch trees, stones, flowers, mushrooms, lillypads, stonewalls, leaves, cliffs. \u003cem\u003eEach come with LODs.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuildings (x5)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCabin, bridge, warpgate, windmills,\u003c\